  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kent.schwartz@stryker.com",
    "text": "<p>Stryker’s learning platform,&nbsp;<a title=\"Visit the FocusRN page.\" href=\"https://strykerlearning.csod.com/login/render.aspx?id=focusrn\" target=\"_blank\">FocusRN</a>&nbsp;has a new website designed with the needs of nurses in mind. The new site is mobile-friendly, making it easy to access from anywhere. The new platform provides clinical education and tools that address the challenges nurses face in patient care every day.</p>\n<p>The new FocusRN offers an enhanced selection of both accredited and non-accredited content. Nurses can also access downloadable resources and interactive e-learning activities.</p>\n<p>Program features include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Interactive modules</li>\n<li>Implementation and assessment tools</li>\n<li>White papers</li>\n<li>Journal references</li>\n<li>Professional guidelines</li>\n<li>Customized workshops</li>\n<li>Clinical expert speaker program</li>\n<li>Protocol examples</li>\n</ul>\n<p>To see the new site for yourself, visit <a title=\"Visit the FocusRN page.\" href=\"https://strykerlearning.csod.com/login/render.aspx?id=focusrn\" target=\"_blank\">FocusRN</a>.</p>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Dec 28 2023 20:21:05 GMT+0000",
    "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
    "textIsRich": "true"
  }
